{"doc_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48", "version_id": "sha256:77dc1a8d41d6a6e8d137d7e1f68608ab8b2009f059e69852adae6acd99d03e09:effective-2021年3月1日:revision-修订", "chunk_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48:row-0008", "row_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48:row-0008", "row_type": "paragraph", "clean_text": "1.为进一步提高政府采购透明度，优化政府采购营商环境，根据《关于开展政府采购意向公开工作的通知》（财库〔2020〕10号）要求，我校的政府采购货物、工程、服务项目（货物、服务单项或批量预算金额达到100万元及以上的；工程预算金额达到120万元及以上的），必须在项目采购活动开始（发布项目招标采购信息公告）前35日将采购意向公开文件（详见附件）发送至邮箱：201701028@muc.edu.cn。", "source_pdf": "canonical.md", "source_url": "campusrag://promotion/internal_notice/0425aed278c86fda", "source": {"id": "campusrag://promotion/internal_notice/0425aed278c86fda"}, "page_start": null, "page_end": null, "entitlement_groups": ["campus_members"], "visibility_scope": "campus", "visibility_level": "restricted", "policy_projection_version": "phase1-authorization-projection-v1", "unit_type": "institutional_regulation_block", "root_unit_id": "institutional_regulation:muc:中央民族大学采购工作管理办法:a2f1da036a48:root", "metadata": {"title": "中央民族大学采购工作管理办法", "semantic_content_hash": "77dc1a8d41d6a6e8d137d7e1f68608ab8b2009f059e69852adae6acd99d03e09", "content_kind": "institutional_regulation", "content_role": "regulation_body", "is_answer_bearing": true, "projection_name": "internal_notice_regulation_promotion", "derived_from": "internal_notice_canonical_document", "derived_from_document_id": "notice:muc_internal_portal:187233", "derived_from_document_ids": ["notice:muc_internal_portal:187233"], "parent_document_id": "notice:muc_internal_portal:187233", "promotion_class": "formal_regulation", "promotion_source_collection": "campus_notices/internal_notice", "source_notice_ids": ["187233"], "source_document_ids": ["notice:muc_internal_portal:187233"], "source_parent_document_id": "notice:muc_internal_portal:187233", "source_parent_document_ids": ["notice:muc_internal_portal:187233"], "source_att